/* Hea Ruatane the Virindi Hunter - Plateau camp hunter (Virindi), marae-hunt.
 * Gives one random Virindi species of the Plateau zone, 50 kills; minimum level 300;
 * reward 1,200,000,000 XP (AwardNoShareXP) + 300,000 Luminance; 20 h cooldown from the claim
 * (MaraeHuntPlateauVirindiWait). Skin cloned from 1004146 Hea Manaia the Hivewatch (Setup, palette, clothing, stats; never its emotes,
 * generators, books, spells, positions or hand items). Wields Chimeric Lance of the Quiddity (1004717).
 * Gender (dialogue/design only - Hea Tumerok weenies carry no gender property): Female. Skins were drawn without regard to gender; swap the template if one reads wrong in game. */

